{"name":"Cut the Cheese","hex":"#deea00","fetched":"2026-10-23","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"cut the cheese","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To fart loudly.","Used other than figuratively or idiomatically: see cut,‎ cheese."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/cut_the_cheese"}],"entries":[{"title":"Flatulence","blocks":[{"text":"Flatulence is the expulsion of gas from the intestines via the anus, commonly referred to as farting. \"Flatus\" is the medical word for gas generated in the stomach or bowels. A proportion of intestinal gas may be swallowed environmental air; hence, flatus is not entirely generated in the stomach or bowels. The scientific study of this area of medicine is termed flatology."}],"link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Flatulence","wikidata":"Q160184"},{"title":"Cheese","blocks":[{"text":"Cheese is a type of dairy product produced in a range of flavors, textures, and forms by curdling of milk, usually from cows, goats or sheep, and sometimes of water buffalo. During production, milk is usually acidified and either the enzymes of rennet or bacterial enzymes with similar activity are added to cause the protein casein to coagulate. The solid curds, consisting of proteins and milkfat, are then separated from the liquid whey and pressed into finished cheese. Some cheeses have aromatic molds on the outer layer or rind, while others have them throughout."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/a/a8/Cheese_platter.jpg/330px-Cheese_platter.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cheese","wikidata":"Q10943"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Hegassen_scroll_segment_33.jpg/500px-Hegassen_scroll_segment_33.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Hegassen_scroll_segment_33.jpg/1280px-Hegassen_scroll_segment_33.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e2/Hegassen_scroll_segment_33.jpg/500px-Hegassen_scroll_segment_33.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"He-gassen (detail), an art scroll depicting a battle of flatulence, from Japan during the Edo period","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AHegassen_scroll_segment_33.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Ikkei_Shosai_Clam_Gathering_%28Fart%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Ikkei_Shosai_Clam_Gathering_%28Fart%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Ikkei_Shosai_Clam_Gathering_%28Fart%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/1280px-Ikkei_Shosai_Clam_Gathering_%28Fart%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/d/d0/Ikkei_Shosai_Clam_Gathering_%28Fart%29_%28cropped%29.jpg/500px-Ikkei_Shosai_Clam_Gathering_%28Fart%29_%28cropped%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"A Japanese ukiyo-e print employing fart humor","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AIkkei_Shosai_Clam_Gathering_(Fart)_(cropped).jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Cow_female_black_white.jpg/500px-Cow_female_black_white.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Cow_female_black_white.jpg/1280px-Cow_female_black_white.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0c/Cow_female_black_white.jpg/500px-Cow_female_black_white.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"The 